<figure id="S6.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Hyperparameters for the LIBERO-90 simulation tasks.
Columns t55–t59 are E-QRL (ours); the last column is the DSRL baseline.
Tasks: t55 = <em id="S6.T4.7" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">alphabet soup <math id="S6.T4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> tray</em>, t10 = <em id="S6.T4.8" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">black bowl <math id="S6.T4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> cabinet</em>,
t57 = <em id="S6.T4.9" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">cream cheese <math id="S6.T4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> tray</em>, t59 = <em id="S6.T4.10" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">tomato sauce <math id="S6.T4.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> tray</em>.
<sup id="S6.T4.11" class="ltx_sup"><span id="S6.T4.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">†</span></sup>Values for t10 are reconstructed from the run name (its config dict was
not saved). The DSRL baseline shares the same configuration across LIBERO tasks
(fixed steps/chunk <math id="S6.T4.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="=10/20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">=10/20</annotation></semantics></math>); “–” marks E-QRL-specific entries.</figcaption>
